{"id": 267, "content": {"raw": "<!-- wp:columns {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center medlux-intro\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-lead\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-lead\">IV treatments deliver vitamins, minerals and other nutrients directly into the bloodstream, so they are fully available to the body. They are designed to support energy, regeneration and overall well-being, and every infusion is selected after a short medical assessment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":882,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-intro-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-intro-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-336.jpg\" alt=\"Woman relaxing during an IV infusion\" class=\"wp-image-882\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Our IV treatments</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":885,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-337.jpg\" alt=\"IV bags with vitamin-rich fruits\" class=\"wp-image-885\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Myers' Cocktail</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A classic infusion with vitamin C, B vitamins, magnesium and calcium to support energy, immunity and general well-being.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":886,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-338.jpg\" alt=\"IV infusion bag\" class=\"wp-image-886\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">NAD+</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Nicotinamide adenine dinucleotide is a coenzyme involved in cellular energy production. The infusion is used to support energy, mental clarity and healthy ageing.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":887,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-339.jpg\" alt=\"Woman with healthy, shiny hair\" class=\"wp-image-887\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hair and Nail Cocktail</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Supports stronger hair and nails and healthy hair growth, and nourishes the follicles, for example after a hair transplant.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":888,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-340.jpg\" alt=\"Woman relaxing in a robe during treatment\" class=\"wp-image-888\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Beauty Cocktail</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Supports skin firmness, smoothness and moisture, promotes collagen production and complements facial mesotherapy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":889,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-341.jpg\" alt=\"Slim waist, weight management theme\" class=\"wp-image-889\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Fat Burning Slim Boost</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>With L-carnitine and other nutrients to support metabolism and fat burning as part of a weight-management programme.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":890,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-342.jpg\" alt=\"IV drip with fresh oranges\" class=\"wp-image-890\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Vitamin C Megadose</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>High-dose vitamin C with antioxidant properties that supports the immune system, tissue regeneration and collagen production.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":891,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-343.jpg\" alt=\"Hands resting on the knee\" class=\"wp-image-891\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Alpha Lipoic Acid</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A strong antioxidant that helps to regenerate other antioxidants such as vitamins C and E and supports nerve health and metabolism.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":892,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-344.jpg\" alt=\"Hands forming a heart on the stomach\" class=\"wp-image-892\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Immune Plus</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Supports immune function, energy metabolism and antioxidant capacity.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":893,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-345.jpg\" alt=\"Smiling woman holding a green smoothie\" class=\"wp-image-893\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Anti-ageing Collagen Booster</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Amino acids, vitamins and minerals that support collagen production, skin health and overall vitality.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-treatment-grid\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-treatment-grid\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card medlux-card\\u002d\\u002dphoto\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card medlux-card--photo\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":980,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"medlux-card-img\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large medlux-card-img\"><img src=\"https://medluxlife.de/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/medluxlife-photo-c267a.jpg\" alt=\"Fresh antioxidant-rich berries\" class=\"wp-image-980\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Glutathione</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>A powerful antioxidant that supports the body's natural detoxification and the immune system and helps protect cells from oxidative stress.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-section\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-section\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How MedLuxLife supports you</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-steps\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"grid\",\"minimumColumnWidth\":\"20rem\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-steps\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Free consultation</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Share your wishes and, if available, recent X-rays or photos. We answer your questions and explain the options.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Personal treatment plan</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Our partner specialists prepare a treatment plan and an estimated timeline tailored to you.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Travel &amp; treatment</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We coordinate your appointments, hotel and airport transfers, so you can focus on your treatment.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-card\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-card\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Aftercare</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>We stay in touch after you return home and help with follow-up questions.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"medlux-cta\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group medlux-cta\"><!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plan your IV treatment with confidence</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every treatment begins with a personal, no-obligation consultation. Contact us and we will get back to you as soon as possible.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-primary\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-primary\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://medluxlife.de/contact/\">Request a Free Consultation</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --><!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"medlux-btn-whatsapp\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button medlux-btn-whatsapp\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://wa.me/380979092326\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"medlux-disclaimer\"} -->\n<p class=\"medlux-disclaimer\">The information on this page is for general guidance only and does not replace a medical consultation. Suitability for any treatment is assessed individually by a qualified doctor.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->"}}